  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India Infoline Finance (IIFL Finance) is a non-banking financial company (NBFC) headquartered in Mumbai. Its portfolio comprises home loans, commercial vehicle finance, gold loans and SME business loans.  It employs a workforce of over 10,500 people with a network of over 1,000 branches across India. IIFL Finance is a wholly-owned subsidiary of IIFL Holdings Ltd, a finance and investment company founded in 1995 by entrepreneurs Nirmal Jain and R. Venkataraman.CDC&#x2019;s relationship with IIFL dates back to 1999 when it was one of the early investors in IIFL&#x2019;s broking business.</narrative>
  </description>
